OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud
OL,6,Fthickening from the west during the
OL,7,Fevening, with an area of rain
OL,8,Fspreading to all overnight, as winds
OL,9,Fback southerly and increase strong to
OL,10,Fnear gale.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FWet, windy through the
OL,13,Fmorning with outbreaks of rain heavy
OL,14,Fat times. Winds easing fresh to strong
OL,15,Fwhile veering west to northwest early
OL,16,Fafternoon, bringing largely dry,
OL,17,Foccasionally sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
